Evrosion is a multi-license project.

First-party Core software: GPL-3.0-only.
Designated SDK/interface software: Apache-2.0.
Eligible first-party documentation prose: CC-BY-4.0.
Third-party material: its original recorded terms, unchanged.

LICENSE_POLICY.md explains the fixed component boundaries. REUSE.toml records
explicit first-party file assignments. Standard unmodified license texts are in
LICENSES/GPL-3.0-only.txt, LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt and LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt.
Upstream notices and terms are preserved under LICENSES/third-party/ and in the
dependency inventory. These first-party assignments do not relicense that material.

Source licensing does not grant trademark or certification rights; see LEGAL.md.
